{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02710","headline":"凌朝浮江旅思 · 马周","name":"凌朝浮江旅思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太清上初日，春水送孤舟。\n山远疑无树，潮平似不流。\n岸花开且落，江鸟没还浮。\n羁望伤千里，长歌遣四愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}